The menu and iconify glyphs are centred on transparent 20x16 canvases;
the other files retain their original image data. Original CDE
copyright notices and XConsortium identifiers remain in the files.
NsCDE distributes these under its COPYING (GPLv3), included here. This
notice applies to this artwork directory, not to CoW's source code.

The example's layout is inspired by NsCDE's
data/fvwm/FrontPanel.fvwm3.fvwmconf: 63-pixel launchers, a 16-pixel
subpanel strip, large 48-pixel icons and a central workspace switcher.
The CoW configuration is independently written; it does not use FVWM code.
